#==============================================================================================
#
#   navigable_taken_ahead - HTML::Navigable: the viewport rect and the container
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/HTML/Navigable.h's viewport_rect (line 194) and Navigable.cpp's
#       container (lines 567-571), taken ahead of region r28 (which owns Navigable) by region
#       r43: every length resolved against an element or a layout node reads its navigable's
#       viewport, and the body's presentational hints ask for the container. Region r28 ports
#       the rest of Navigable around them.
